= The Hutts Turn

Orn Free Taa does not shout. He sends back the Caucus's last message unopened, and lets it be known in the Senate's corridors that [+ hutt_turned_why +]. Within days, his senators are dining with the Chancellor's people, and the Hutt clans' accounts on Coruscant are moving.

Nobody in the Caucus expects the Hutts to forget.
